      "text": "Free is the whole game. Same twelve months, same pitch, same scoring, same board. Pro opens more of the world \u2014 never a better game. FREE $0 Four industries, whole game One company a day \u2014 no redo The full pitch, scored the same The wardrobe track banks progress PLAY FREE PRO $6.99 / month OR $39.99 A YEAR \u2014 $43.89 LESS All twelve industries Three companies a day The Room \u2014 cold-call real investors Wear the wardrobe you earn MONTHLY YEARLY Billed by Stripe. Both plans renew automatically \u2014 $6.99 each month or $39.99 each year \u2014 until you cancel, which you can do at any time from Settings. Term",
